<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Reset Your PettyCash Password</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
    <h2>Hello, {{name}}!</h2>
    <p>We received a request to reset the password for your PettyCash account.</p>
    <p>To create a new password, please click the link below:</p>
    <p><a href="{{resetLink}}" style="background-color: #007bff; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;">Reset My Password</a></p>
    <p><strong>This link will expire in 24 hours for security reasons.</strong></p>
    <p>If you didn't request this password reset, please ignore this email. Your account remains secure.</p>
    <p>Need help? Contact our support team by replying to this email.</p>
    <br>
    <p>Best regards,<br>The PettyCash Team</p>
    <br>
    <small>This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly to this message.</small>
  </body>
</html>